      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKING GEMS (6) is a promising dog in the frame at eight of 15 starts including five wins and was in the minors again latest (30.41) over 525m at Wagga. Strike rate this distance strong having won two of four tries. Looks well placed here and should prove hard to beat again. BOBBIN' BRUNO (7) recorded back to back wins before placing last time after copping a check in the run, finishing a 2.5 lengths third (30.00) in a Grade 5 at this track. Bold showing expected again. NEW SURPRISE (1) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at Richmond over 401m. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Expected to be in the finish again. RAMSET READY (2) cannot be ruled out.",
